WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.564
RUFUS: The mechanism is specifically
worth sitting with. The association
isn't saying AI

00:00:04.564 --> 00:00:09.127
RUFUS: is ordering unnecessary tests.
They're saying providers are billing for
more severe

00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:13.691
RUFUS: patient care. Which means AI is
either helping clinicians identify
severity they

00:00:13.691 --> 00:00:18.255
RUFUS: would have previously missed —
which is arguably good —

00:00:18.345 --> 00:00:21.739
RUFUS: or it's making a billing argument
that the insurer doesn't believe
reflects

00:00:21.739 --> 00:00:25.133
RUFUS: genuine clinical complexity.

00:00:25.346 --> 00:00:29.212
ALEX: And the association covers more
than a hundred million people across 31

00:00:29.212 --> 00:00:33.077
ALEX: independent insurers. So this
isn't a regional quirk.

00:00:33.187 --> 00:00:35.932
JAMIE: What's the limit on the finding,
though? Because this is the insurer's

00:00:35.932 --> 00:00:38.676
JAMIE: study, not an independent audit.
